WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.040 --> 00:00:02.594
(laughter)

00:00:02.594 --> 00:00:03.570
- What is this?

00:00:03.570 --> 00:00:05.735
(electronic music)

00:00:07.680 --> 00:00:08.945
- We have a saying in French.

00:00:08.945 --> 00:00:12.274
Cheese that does not smell
can not be an honest cheese.

00:00:12.274 --> 00:00:14.491
- We like to eat cheese
with wine, and just,

00:00:14.491 --> 00:00:16.697
we eat it for the cheese,
whereas here, cheese

00:00:16.697 --> 00:00:18.276
you eat it with something else.

00:00:18.276 --> 00:00:21.132
- Yea with crackers or in
France you just eat cheese,

00:00:21.132 --> 00:00:22.792
just a piece of cheese like this.

00:00:22.792 --> 00:00:23.907
- And not with crackers.

00:00:23.907 --> 00:00:24.685
- Yea, nothing.

00:00:24.685 --> 00:00:27.042
- Not necessarily looking
forward to trying this but,

00:00:27.042 --> 00:00:28.688
- Let's see!

00:00:28.688 --> 00:00:30.336
(jazzy instrumental music)

00:00:30.336 --> 00:00:31.729
- It's just one color.

00:00:31.729 --> 00:00:32.310
- Yea.

00:00:32.310 --> 00:00:34.945
- It's just, there's no
like little things in it.

00:00:34.945 --> 00:00:36.144
- No spice or nothing.

00:00:36.144 --> 00:00:36.745
- Nothing.

00:00:36.745 --> 00:00:37.559
- It's very simple.

00:00:37.559 --> 00:00:39.692
(jazzy instrumental music)

00:00:39.692 --> 00:00:41.317
- It's not bad but it's
what we call in France

00:00:41.317 --> 00:00:43.988
the cheese for kid.

00:00:43.988 --> 00:00:46.995
- It tastes like cheese for one
second and then it does not.

00:00:46.995 --> 00:00:50.582
- It has a bit of bitterness
to it but very, very light.

00:00:51.522 --> 00:00:53.400
- Doesn't it feel a bit smoked?

00:00:53.400 --> 00:00:54.271
- Tastes milky.

00:00:54.271 --> 00:00:55.861
- It tastes like the
cream you put in coffee,

00:00:55.861 --> 00:00:56.825
like half and half.

00:00:56.825 --> 00:00:59.170
(jazzy instrumental music)

00:00:59.170 --> 00:01:01.121
- Oh my. This looks like mayo.

00:01:01.121 --> 00:01:03.617
- The texture is very sandy and dry.

00:01:04.847 --> 00:01:05.831
- How does it taste?

00:01:05.831 --> 00:01:09.871
- I taste like those little
cheese puff that you can buy.

00:01:09.871 --> 00:01:12.518
- Mayonnaise cheese sauce with a bit

00:01:12.518 --> 00:01:14.503
of light orange coloring.

00:01:14.503 --> 00:01:17.429
- It's like a mixture
between salty and sweet

00:01:17.429 --> 00:01:22.429
but at the same time it's
neither and really acidic.

00:01:24.223 --> 00:01:25.545
- You're in a rush to get your food,

00:01:25.545 --> 00:01:26.809
you're going to get food that tastes

00:01:26.809 --> 00:01:29.514
like it has been made in a rush.

00:01:29.514 --> 00:01:32.196
And it doesn't have to taste bad

00:01:32.196 --> 00:01:34.251
but won't taste as good as it could be.

00:01:34.251 --> 00:01:36.306
- You should eat food
because you enjoy it,

00:01:36.306 --> 00:01:37.756
you enjoy the taste of it,
you shouldn't just eat it

00:01:37.756 --> 00:01:39.403
to fill yourself up.
- Yea.

00:01:39.403 --> 00:01:41.980
- And a lot of this
American cheese in general

00:01:41.980 --> 00:01:43.710
feels just like to fill yourself up

00:01:43.710 --> 00:01:45.753
or to put on a burger
and just kind of eat it.

00:01:45.753 --> 00:01:46.914
- And it doesn't taste, it doesn't taste.

00:01:46.914 --> 00:01:47.623
- It doesn't taste like anything.

00:01:47.623 --> 00:01:49.608
- So it's not good for your body

00:01:49.608 --> 00:01:52.147
and it isn't good for your
desire to eat something good.

00:01:52.147 --> 00:01:52.397
- Yea.

00:01:52.397 --> 00:01:55.549
(upbeat instrumental music)

